  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f867e729cd163844296773769e23f97f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Kahnan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Rarety: 0
  m_Description: "Kahnan, a fierce fire demon, burns with the fury of rebellion.
    When the new demon king was crowned, many\u2014including Kahnan\u2014questioned
    the legitimacy of his rule. The new monarch lacked the ancient Hitaro\u2014the
    eyes of the demon kings passed down through generations\u2014and, more disturbingly,
    could not wield the legendary Demon King's Sword. For Kahnan, and many other
    tribes, this was a sign that the throne had fallen into unworthy hands. Refusing
    to pledge loyalty, Kahnan went seeking a leader worth following.\\n\\nAccording
    to the ancient legends of his people, there was once a forgotten king, the true
    origin of demon royalty. This ancient ruler's power was said to have been stolen
    by the current king's bloodline, imprisoning him in a dark dimension to erase
    his existence. Kahnan\u2019s purpose is clear\u2014he will lead his people on
    a quest to find this lost king and restore him to the throne. In doing so, he
    believes the demons will regain their rightful strength and rise to victory under
    a true, powerful ruler. Kahnan\u2019s resolve is unyielding; he will scorch every
    obstacle in his path, be it demon or human, to see his mission fulfilled and
    the true king restored."
  m_DescriptionVariables: []
  m_SpellElements: 01000000
  m_AutoAttack: Fireball
  m_SpecialAbility: IgnitionVeil
  m_Ultimate: PyroBlast
